  "policy": "Exact upstream bytes; no resizing, recompression, repainting or generated substitutions.",
  "included": [
    "Spill ship upgrade kit, utilities and fitting metadata; unused tiny cockpit/blue-hull alternatives remain with the complete kit.",
    "Spill depot, panorama, bear marshal and workshop; the original README provenance travels with scene and ship art.",
    "Default Flight pilot still, 12 tap and four dive frames; Clear helmet and eight original squirrel fallback frames.",
    "27 legacy debris IDs selected by Spill; Acorn Coin and original animated acorn/golden fallback banks.",
    "Hyper Run scout-ship is retained only as Spill's existing missing-kit fallback, not as a playable mode.",
    "Self-hosted Figtree/Fraunces fonts with original CSS, README and OFL license texts.",
    "Menu and Flight streamed music are the two tracks used by Spill; synthesized effects remain in audio.ts."
  ],
  "omitted": [
    "Other pilot suits, helmets and PALs, all roster background prefetch and non-Spill zone loading.",
    "Planet/zone sky libraries, later debris IDs27-54, vortex and Hyper Run portal art.",
    "Vanguard-specific depot cameo; no Vanguard selection exists in this extracted baseline.",
    "Other-mode pickup banks and marketing/shop/campaign art. Shared code/types remain for baseline parity.",
    "Voyage music belongs to Hyper Run; Cosmos music belongs to retro play. Neither mode is launched here."
  ],
